    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303536600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303542733333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303544733333
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF88602. It's for the ClubFit Jersey.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303549999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it, one moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the order. And what specifically is the issue with the jersey?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303553333332
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size. It's just way too tight across the shoulders. I thought about an exchange, but I'll just return it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303561333332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Getting the right fit is crucial. Let me just check the delivery date here... I see it was delivered 36 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303569533332
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303578199998
    },
    {
