      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303578899998
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what happens now?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303589899998
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a return shipping label to the email address on file. Just print that out, attach it to the package with the jersey inside, and drop it off at any post office. Once we receive it, we'll process your full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303591833331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I'll get the email then. Is that all?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44608,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769303607099997
